    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Dylan Gibbs",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101880623447178707624/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKiF6-_RsQA3cUyWKuHOMRSHl7vXjlz3XRz4A9SaNtysQRQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Eco Plus did an amazing job transforming my backyard! The space looks completely refreshed, and their attention to detail really shows. Brandon and Ryan were fantastic—super easy to work with, communicative, and clearly care about getting things right. Highly recommend them if you're looking for quality work and a smooth experience.",
        "time": 1758721440,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "James Mackenzie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110164222785749929034/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX8wITvm2_socvUYvB6L7K1rmG5rn9B8ZzhzXVwu5pRQ2acmc9n=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Ecoplus Landscaping did an amazing job redoing my front walkway with unistone and adding a raised garden bed using natural stone to create a wall along the walkway. They really listened to my ideas and offered great feedback and suggestions that I hadn't thought of, which ended up being perfect for our home.\n\nThey truly are experts and paid great attention to detail. They completed the project on time and within budget, and the quality of their work is fantastic. Our front yard looks better than ever!\n\nI highly recommend Ecoplus Landscaping for any landscaping projects. Their expertise and dedication to customer satisfaction truly make them stand out.",
        "time": 1716830296,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Benoit D.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118175030138574266729/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxwcrSN3u_Wl3WgebNu5abneQYmyig-o-MHX2qsNXrJki5xX8j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Ecoplus were referred to us by Pépinière Cité-des-Jeunes and they were great to work with from the first meeting all the way to the end of the project.\n\nThey listened, proposed solutions, were always  positive and laughing, humble, showed up when they said they would and there were no bad surprises at the end. It was also very reassuring to see their attention to details.\n\nOne of the most important thing for us is that we felt through the entire project that they genuinely cared about doing the job right. On a few occasions when something didn’t feel right, they would reach out to us with suggestions that made more sense instead of just executing what we first had in mind. These guys are proud professionals and I have no hesitation to refer them to anyone.\n\nWe are grateful and can’t thank you enough for creating this space for us. We wish you all the best for the future!",
        "time": 1720046231,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Asif Ahmad",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100993131385048746346/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIBXbEj-uACoX1ffC96vYi148UWvWMDKM2I_DH-oKM8-ioP7w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I'm very happy with Ecoplus Lanscaping's work. Very professional, high quality materials and workmanship and reasonable price. Would be happy to work with them again.",
        "time": 1696255330,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Magnabosco",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106072427587628096985/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXMpJ0g-EK7aQLqFhfH_MXrZ8S4WI_0N-fVqMzMT5GiL20L-Jya=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
